// tables: DeviceNetworkEvents
// purpose: Hunting VEILDrive C2
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/Hunting%20VEILDrive%20C2.kql
// kind: repo
